":"","readingDescription3":"\u003ch2\u003eRead {0} Online \u003c/h2\u003e \u003cbr\u003e\nLatest Chapters: {5}. \u003cbr\u003e Get full chapter list \u003ca href=\"{2}\"\u003ehere\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nYou're reading \u003cstrong\u003e{0}\u003c/strong\u003e, alternative name {1}. Its covering in genres of {7}. Come visit us at anytime, we will always give you the latest, newest and hottest novels everyday.\nDid you hear or read \u003cstrong\u003e{0}\u003c/strong\u003e? Lets discover now at {1}. \u003ca href=\"{2}\" title=\"Read {0}\"\u003e{0}\u003c/a\u003e novel, written by {6}, the most popular novel covering in {7} categories.\nHave more {4} translated chapters and other chapters are in progress. You will get the update soon!\nAt {9}, you can read a lot of novels, thousand of novels with daily update, such as Light Novel, Web novel, Korean novel...\u003cbr/\u003e\nLets create an account and add \u003cstrong\u003e{0}\u003c/strong\u003e to your bookmark. And you to access your bookmark from multiple devices.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eTags: {8}","homeDescription":"","readingTip":"","chapterDescription":""},"analytics":{"gaId":"","gtagId":""},"authMode":"internal","layoutTheme":"flux","footer":{"termofservice":"Terms of Service","dmca":"DMCA","contact":"Contact","sitemap":"Sitemap","description":"","copyright":""},"i18n":{"locales":["en"],"defaultLocale":"en","localeDetection":true},"themeColor":"","turnstileSiteKey":"0x4AAAAAADzUuak486I_tfK8","googleClientId":"1000153352534-23orobcnu2daq00j58hbpb79br1hfo4g.apps.googleusercontent.com","authHub":{"hubUrl":"https://auth.novelbuddy.com"}},"deviceType":"desktop","isClientNav":false,"initialChapter":{"id":"YenzjyvD","url":"/mtl-solo-not-solo/chapter-1-company-commander-you-are-hard","name":"Chapter 1 Company commander, you are hard...","slug":"chapter-1-company-commander-you-are-hard","views":0,"comments_count":0,"updated_at":"2026-08-21T19:55:13.000Z","number":1,"cv":1787342127230,"content":"\n\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\nOn the polished glass coffee table, there are two USB interface mice, one USB interface keyboard, one card reader, and one mobile hard disk.Shan Fei checked the delivery list, made sure nothing was left behind, took a white plastic bag and put all these things in, then flipped through the wallet, saw the ID card in it, and then twisted his hips with the things , get out of the house.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe place he is going today is a regiment-level unit under the S military region, number 301.There was a company commander named Liu Zhendong who was an old classmate and comrade-in-arms of their manager.The things in his hand were given to this Company Commander Liu.Originally, the manager was always responsible for this matter, but recently the manager went on a business trip, so it was his turn to run errands.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI have been to the 301st regiment before solo, but at that time I went there in the manager's car, and I didn't suffer any crimes along the way.But this time was different, he had to take a bus, and he had to reverse the bus halfway.The first bus was okay, the destination was at the entrance of their company building, and there were still seats available when going up.But the one that needs to be transferred is not so good. Not to mention the broken car, there are too many people.He had been fortunate enough to witness the grand occasion in that car several times, it was really crowded like never before.It is an exaggeration to say that every time he saw that car, he felt that the car might be broken by the crowd in the next second.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRight now, flying solo is like dough being kneaded, being squeezed by all kinds of pressure, it looks like a steamed bun in one second, and it may turn into a flower roll in the next second...\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eShan Fei used all his strength to pull out his arm and wiped his sweat. After wiping, he realized that this arm could no longer be put down. There was no room for him to put down his arm!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFinally, the car wobbled to the finish line.He was led out of the car by the crowd, and found that his shirt was already soaked, and it was extremely cool when the wind blew, which was in stark contrast to the traffic in the car.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe 301 regiment was still a short distance away from the bus stop, so they did not dare to delay the solo flight, and continued to walk south with their bags.Fortunately, he protected it tightly. Although the bag was a little wrinkled, it was not broken.He had to deliver these things to Company Commander Liu before two o'clock in the afternoon. The manager had repeatedly instructed him not to make mistakes.It's twenty one past one, so we should be in time.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"Hello, comrade, who are you looking for?\" As soon as Shan Fei arrived at the door, the guards stopped him and asked him routinely.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"Hello, squad leader, I'm from Fengyue Technology Co., Ltd., and I'm looking for company commander Liu Zhendong.\" Shan Fei quickly took out his ID card and handed it over.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe guard looked at it carefully, and then stretched his neck and shouted: \"Xiao Zhang, come here!!\" After that, he took out the registration book and pen and handed it to Solo, \"Please register here.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSolo took over the register and filled it out carefully according to the format above.He also heard the guard say to the man who was called: \"You take Comrade Shan to find Company Commander Liu, hurry up.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eShan Fei said and Xie followed Xiao Zhang, almost jogging towards a small white building with a height of six floors.Although the ground is very flat, but the distance is not close, Xiao Zhang was a little out of breath when he ran close, but Shan Fei was stunned.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eXiao Zhang suppressed the surprise in his heart, and said to Shan Fei: \"Dude, you have good physical strength, have you practiced?\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eShan Fei resisted the movement of hitting his left knee, giggled, \"Ten kilometers of armed cross-country, I practice every day in my dream.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eXiao Zhang: \"...\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eXiao Zhang took Solo to the fourth floor and stopped in front of Room 406.There is no so-called company commander's office or regimental commander's office here. At a glance, the doors are full of house numbers.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFlying alone doesn't have much curiosity, he just wants to quickly deliver things to the other party and then go home to take a shower and change clothes.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eXiao Zhang knocked on the door, and a non-commissioned officer came out, and whispered: \"There is a meeting inside, what's the matter?\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eXiao Zhang let Solo out, and Solo repeated what he said at the gate.The non-commissioned officer responded, went in and said something, and then came out quickly, \"Our company commander has been waiting for a long time, just give me the things.\" After speaking, he said to Xiao Zhang: \"Xiao Zhang, take the list first. Comrade, go to the lounge, and the company commander will be done in half an hour.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSolo Fei originally planned to go back after delivering the goods, because the manager had explained before that he didn't need to collect money, but he seemed to have something to explain, so he went to the lounge on the second floor with Xiao Zhang.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eXiao Zhang sent the person to the place, got another glass of pure water and went out, but he didn't go far.Hearing footsteps, he should be guarding outside the lounge door.After all, this is the army, and it has its own set of rules, so I didn't think too much about flying solo, just looked around casually, and sat quietly on the sofa waiting for Liu Zhendong.Half an hour is not too long, if you use your mobile phone to watch something or play a game, it will pass in a while.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eShan Fei subconsciously fumbled for his pocket, wondering if he should try to eat the snake first, only to find that his cell phone was missing!He obviously brought it with him when he came out, but now he didn't have any of the pockets he had emptied all over his body!The biggest possibility is that people touched it in the car.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhen Liu Zhendong opened the lounge door, Shan Fei was pouting, looking a little annoyed, and didn't notice his arrival.Liu Zhendong paused, neither stepped forward nor made a sound.At this time, Shan Fei's pointed chin was resting on the back of his hand, his lips were pursed from time to time, and sometimes pursed, this changing expression was interesting to watch, and one couldn't help... wanting to bully him.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"Cough.\" Liu Zhendong coughed lightly to suppress his inferiority, and lit a cigarette for himself.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSolo finally reacted and looked at the people who came.He didn't know who this person was, so he just said with Liu Zhendong's epaulet: \"Hello, Captain.\"Their manager came out of the army, so Solo knew very well about the military rank.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe voice was so nice, Liu Zhendong thought to himself, and stretched out his hand, \"Hello, I am Liu Zhendong, the company commander here, you can call me Lianchang Liu.\" After speaking, he shook the cigarette case, \"Would you like one?\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"Hi Lien-chang, I don't smoke.\" Shan Fei subconsciously took a step back, but kicked the sofa, because there was no place behind him to retreat.He himself is 1.7 meters 1.8, which is not short, but the opposite one must be at least [-] meters [-], which gives people a sense of oppression.I don't know if it's because of being a soldier, but there is a feeling of domineering.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThat's not right, that Xiao Zhang doesn't have this kind of momentum, and he's obviously not short either.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eShan Fei looked at Liu Zhendong secretly, and thought to himself: Could this be the legendary arrogance of an official? !But I have to say, this guy is very handsome, look at that face, he has all the facial features that the world is most proud of.Not only that, but with that body, it will definitely make the majority of men jealous and envious.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLiu Zhendong ignored Solo's scrutiny and motioned Solo to sit down, and sat down opposite him.Solo waited for the other party to speak, but Liu Zhendong didn't say a word for a long time, just stared at him for a moment, a little curious and... Solo couldn't tell what it was like, anyway, he just saw that something was wrong with him, almost He thought that the other party had seen his own thoughts.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAfter a while, Liu Zhendong said, \"I have a grudge against you?\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eShan Fei was stunned for a moment, and couldn't help but let out a \"ah?\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLiu Zhendong lit a cigarette for himself, and said slowly, \"I'm going to be promoted to major next month.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"……Congratulations.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"But...the hard drive you brought me not only prevents me from being promoted, but also punishes me. Tell me... how will you compensate me?\" Liu Zhendong smiled inscrutablely, and held up the small square box in his hand.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSolo didn't expect it to be like this. He didn't look at the hard drive when he took it, but the manager said that there was only one mobile hard drive with a hard drive box in the box, and it was impossible to take it wrong.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"What's wrong with this hard drive?\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"You can see for yourself.\" Liu Zhendong called Xiao Zhang outside the door, gave a few instructions, and after a while Xiao Zhang brought a laptop and handed it to Liu Zhendong, and then went out and closed the door.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLiu Zhendong turned on the computer, connected the hard drive in his hand, and handed over the notebook to Solo.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eShan Fei took it over and opened the hard drive, only to find a bunch of folders inside.The names are similar, basically the four words \"confidential document\" plus a bunch of numbers.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSolo opened one of the folders, saw that there were audio-visual files in it, there was no specific name, and it was just a number, so he clicked it again.As a result, the audio-visual player software played a picture that he could never have imagined.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTwo people, more specifically two men, overlapped each other, each holding each other's avatar in a 69 position, constantly hesitating, interspersed with extremely ambiguous panting sounds.Then very quickly, the picture changed.The stronger man on the top stood up, patted the butt of the man below, then adjusted his posture, and entered the man smoothly...\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLiu Zhendong's expression was very subtle, he wanted to see how this cute kid with rich facial expressions would react.Was it blushing with shame, or turning pale with fright?Or, ask him to give him a chance to explain?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHowever, what he didn't expect was that Shan Fei was actually very calm, with only a suspicious expression on his clear face.After that, his eyes moved down, stopped somewhere, and said very calmly: \"Liu Lianchang, you are hard...\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n","summary":"On the polished glass coffee table, there are two USB interface mice, one USB interface keyboard, one card reader, and one mobile hard disk.Shan Fei checked the delivery list, made sure nothing was left behind, took a white plastic bag and put all these things in, then flipped through the wallet, saw the ID card in it, and then twisted his hips with the things , get out of the house. The place he is going today is a regiment-level unit under the S military region, number 301.There was a company...","word_count":1855,"reading_time_minutes":10,"latest_comments":[]},"initialManga":{"id":"g8j49rzD","url":"/mtl-solo-not-solo","name":"MTL-solo not solo","slug":"mtl-solo-not-solo","cover":"https://rs.novelbuddy.me/covers/solo-not-solo.webp","status":"Completed","stats":{"day_views":0,"week_views":0,"month_views":0},"updated_at":"2026-08-21T19:55:27.000Z","cv":1787342127230,"is_new":false,"is_hot":false,"is_adult":false,"cover_censored":false,"genres":[{"name":"Military","slug":"military"}]},"nextChapter":{"id":"DxJGm438","url":"/mtl-solo-not-solo/chapter-2","name":"Chapter 2","slug":"chapter-2","updated_at":"2026-08-21T19:55:13.000Z","number":2,"cv":1787342127230},"previousChapter":null,"initialError":null,"mangaHsid":"g8j49rzD","chapterHsid":"YenzjyvD","readerSettings":null,"chapterError":null,"_sentryTraceData":"fbf5e29b7a293ecf0cc6971adfd14f52-5e48061f008bb089-0","_sentryBaggage":"sentry-environment=production,sentry-release=2644ed0e17c42d6cc03ce5d4450d59e50498f10a,sentry-public_key=ea1fb19723ec2ae851f269689ea5a07d,sentry-trace_id=fbf5e29b7a293ecf0cc6971adfd14f52,sentry-org_id=4511054323908608,sentry-sampled=false,sentry-sample_rand=0.461013036349433,sentry-sample_rate=0.1"},"__N_SSP":true},"page":"/[slug]/[chapter-slug]","query":{"slug":"mtl-solo-not-solo","chapter-slug":"chapter-1-company-commander-you-are-hard"},"buildId":"9P0SYeE3d2XUw1wq7ihOs","isFallback":false,"isExperimentalCompile":false,"dynamicIds":[52365,99824],"gssp":true,"scriptLoader":[]}</script><script type="module" src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js/v4bc70e2c01a94c73b74392e4234840661791215815920" integrity="sha512-L0ha0OXavK/8okipN9F8BtP84dg9DUhPERbBXzwI6dgTA55d2+yweo3pn5CSFYs45/r8md2+xvUPtTdvTNRfjA==" data-cf-beacon='{"version":"2024.11.0","token":"c547761d659945bb87149aaa470d3ebd","r":1,"spa":2}' crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
